{
  "info": {
    "name": "Circle App API — Demo Mentor",
    "_postman_id": "circle-app-dw66-fiastara",
    "description": "Koleksi API Circle App untuk demo ke mentor bootcamp DW66.\nBase URL: http://localhost:7001/api\n\nAlur: Register → Login → (token auto-saved) → CRUD Thread → Like → Reply → Cache → Follow",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:7001/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "thread_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 AUTH",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "STEP 1 — Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.user && res.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', res.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ User ID saved:', res.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201 - Register berhasil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response punya field user', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('user');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"fia_star\",\n  \"email\": \"fia@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Fia Fiastara\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Registrasi user baru.\n\n✅ Yang terjadi di backend:\n- Password di-hash menggunakan bcrypt\n- Data disimpan ke tabel `users` di PostgreSQL\n- Response mengembalikan user tanpa password"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 2 — Login (auto-save token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ JWT Token tersimpan!');",
                  "    console.log('Token (30 char):', res.token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.user && res.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', res.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Login berhasil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response punya JWT token', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Token format JWT (3 bagian)', () => {",
                  "    const parts = res.token.split('.');",
                  "    pm.expect(parts.length).to.equal(3);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"fia@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login user.\n\n✅ Yang terjadi:\n- Email & password diverifikasi\n- JWT token di-generate dengan payload: userId, username, email\n- Token disimpan otomatis ke variable {{token}} via Tests script\n\n💡 Coba decode token di: https://jwt.io"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 3a — Get Profile [TANPA TOKEN → 401]",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 - Ditolak tanpa token', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response ada pesan error', () => {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('error');",
                  "    console.log('❌ Auth Middleware bekerja:', res.error);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["profile"]
            },
            "description": "❌ SENGAJA TANPA TOKEN untuk demo Auth Middleware.\n\nHasilnya 401 Unauthorized — bukti middleware bekerja."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 3b — Get Profile [DENGAN TOKEN → 200]",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Profil berhasil diambil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response ada field username', () => {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('username');",
                  "    console.log('✅ Auth Middleware lolos. User:', res.fullName);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["profile"]
            },
            "description": "✅ Dengan token JWT di header Authorization.\n\nAuth Middleware memvalidasi token → request diteruskan ke controller."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile (multipart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "fullName",
                  "value": "Fia Fiastara Updated",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "bio",
                  "value": "Frontend dev ✨ | DW Bootcamp Batch 66",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "avatar",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Opsional: pilih file gambar"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile/update",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["profile", "update"]
            },
            "description": "Update profil dengan fullName, bio, dan avatar (gambar).\nMenggunakan multipart/form-data karena ada file upload."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🧵 THREADS",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "STEP 4 — Create Thread",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.thread && res.thread.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('thread_id', res.thread.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Thread ID saved:', res.thread.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201 - Thread berhasil dibuat', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response ada field thread.id', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.thread).to.have.property('id');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "content",
                  "value": "Hello dari Postman! Ini thread pertama saya 🔥 #CircleApp #DWBootcamp",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Opsional: pilih file gambar"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads"]
            },
            "description": "Buat thread baru.\n\n✅ Yang terjadi:\n- Content disimpan ke tabel `threads`\n- Jika ada gambar, file disimpan via Multer ke folder /uploads\n- Thread ID disimpan otomatis ke variable {{thread_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 5 — Get All Threads (Feed)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Feed berhasil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response adalah array', () => {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    console.log('✅ Total threads di feed:', res.length);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil semua thread untuk feed.\nData termasuk: user info, jumlah likes, jumlah replies, status isLiked."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Thread Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads/{{thread_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads", "{{thread_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil detail thread beserta semua replies."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 6 — Toggle Like (kirim 2x!)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Toggle like berhasil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response ada field liked', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('liked');",
                  "    const status = res.liked ? '❤️ LIKED' : '🤍 UNLIKED';",
                  "    console.log('Toggle status:', status);",
                  "    console.log('Kirim lagi untuk toggle balik!');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads/{{thread_id}}/like",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads", "{{thread_id}}", "like"]
            },
            "description": "Toggle Like/Unlike thread.\n\n💡 Kirim 2x untuk demo:\n- Kirim 1: liked=true (Like)\n- Kirim 2: liked=false (Unlike)\n\nData disimpan/dihapus dari tabel `likes` di PostgreSQL."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 7 — Reply Thread",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 - Reply berhasil', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response ada field reply', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('reply');",
                  "    console.log('✅ Reply ID:', res.reply?.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Keren banget threadnya! Keep it up! 👏🔥\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads/{{thread_id}}/reply",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads", "{{thread_id}}", "reply"]
            },
            "description": "Balas thread.\nData tersimpan ke tabel `replies` dengan relasi ke thread dan user."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 8a — My Threads [DB Miss - Pertama kali]",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Cek source cache/database', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('source');",
                  "    const icon = res.source === 'cache' ? '⚡ REDIS HIT' : '🗄️ DB MISS';",
                  "    console.log('=== REDIS STATUS ===');",
                  "    console.log(icon + ' — source:', res.source);",
                  "    console.log('Total threads:', res.data?.length);",
                  "    if (res.source === 'cache') {",
                  "        console.log('Data berasal dari Redis Cache!');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        console.log('Data dari DB. Akan di-cache ke Redis 60 detik.');",
                  "        console.log('Kirim lagi dalam 60 detik → source akan jadi cache!');",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads/my",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads", "my"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil thread milik sendiri.\n\n🔴 PERTAMA kali kirim → source: 'database' (DB Miss)\nData diambil dari PostgreSQL lalu disimpan ke Redis.\n\nKirim lagi dalam 60 detik → STEP 8b (Cache Hit!)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "STEP 8b — My Threads [Redis Hit - Kirim lagi <60dtk]",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Source harus cache (Redis Hit)', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res).to.have.property('source');",
                  "    const icon = res.source === 'cache' ? '⚡ REDIS HIT' : '🗄️ DB MISS';",
                  "    console.log('=== REDIS STATUS ===');",
                  "    console.log(icon + ' — source:', res.source);",
                  "    if (res.source === 'cache') {",
                  "        console.log('✅ Data berasal dari Redis!');",
                  "        console.log('Tidak ada query ke PostgreSQL!');",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        console.log('⚠️ Masih DB. Coba kirim lebih cepat (< 60 detik dari step 8a)');",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/threads/my",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["threads", "my"]
            },
            "description": "⚡ Kirim DALAM 60 DETIK setelah Step 8a!\n\n→ source: 'cache' (Redis Hit!)\nData langsung dari Redis tanpa query ke PostgreSQL."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
